    Stage the Founder reporting policy in two smoke fixtures
    
    Both fixtures run government/executive-cycle.sh against a temporary town but
    never staged government/AGENT-REPORTING-POLICY.md, so the cycle exited 1 at its
    policy check ("mandatory Founder agent policy missing") and the tests were red
    on main for an environment gap unrelated to the code under test.
    
    Verified on this branch: sh tests/appointment-recovery-integration-smoke.sh ->
    exit 0 (appointment recovery integration tests passed); sh
    tests/act19-office-continuity-smoke.sh -> exit 0 (Act 19 office-continuity and
    handoff smoke checks passed). sh tests/run-all.sh now advances past both and
    stops at the next known red, tests/boot-smoke.sh, which needs the separate
    fixture repair 56e8a69.

